emies corpses to become more powerful.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/462860/extras/5eea251982ea89fc5d69e03e4d48a3ee.avif?t=1588201956\" width=630 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/462860/extras/068356863a037914235c05bdf752ded5.avif?t=1588201956\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>Play online co-op or brawl with up to 16 players on 12 different multiplayer maps.",
